@page "/"

<PageTitle>CourtTime - Book a court</PageTitle>

<section class="hero rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5 mb-4">
    <h1 class="display-6 fw-bold">Book a court without the back-and-forth</h1>
    <p class="lead mb-4">
        CourtTime shows real-time availability for beach tennis, padel and futsal courts,
        so players reserve a slot themselves and facilities keep one reliable schedule.
    </p>
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <a class="btn btn-accent btn-lg" href="courts">Find a court</a>
        <AuthorizeView>
            <NotAuthorized>
                <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" href="Account/Register">Create a free account</a>
            </NotAuthorized>
        </AuthorizeView>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="row g-4" aria-label="How it works">
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <h2 class="h5">1. Find a court</h2>
        <p>Filter by sport and compare surface, price and opening hours.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <h2 class="h5">2. Pick a free hour</h2>
        <p>The daily calendar shows which slots are free, taken or reserved by the facility.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <h2 class="h5">3. Play and manage</h2>
        <p>Reschedule or cancel from My bookings. Facility managers see every booking on one schedule.</p>
    </div>
</section>
